# Hosts that answer a link checker differently from a browser, so a failure
# here says nothing about whether the link works.
#
# 403 to datacentre IPs (bot protection):
https://access\.redhat\.com/.*
https://www\.ibm\.com/.*
https://medium\.com/?$
# Intermittent 5xx:
https://ceph\.io/?$
# Serves a certificate for one.com after a redirect; the PDF itself is fine:
https://kernel\.dk/.*
